      "id": "tab3",
      "title": "Đọc 例文(れいぶん) (ví dụ)",
      "titleHtml": "Đọc <ruby>例文<rp>(</rp><rt>れいぶん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby> (</span>ví dụ<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">)",
      "contentHtml": "</span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><audio controls preload=\"none\"><source src=\"/Audio/minnamoi/bunkeireibun/011111101002.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">1．</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai6_rb_1.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"></span><span>お<ruby>酒<rp>(</rp><rt>さけ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を <ruby>飲<rp>(</rp><rt>の</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>みますか。</span><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Anh/chị có uống rượu không?<span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"></div></div></div></span></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"></span><span>&hellip; いいえ、<ruby>飲<rp>(</rp><rt>の</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>みません。</span><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&hellip;Không, tôi không uống.<span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"></div></div></div></span></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">2．</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai6_rb_2.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"></span><span><ruby>毎朝<rp>(</rp><rt>まいあさ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby> <ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なに</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を <ruby>食<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>べますか。</span><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Mỗi sáng anh/chị ăn g&igrave;?<span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"></div></div></div></span></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"></span><span>&hellip;パンと <ruby>卵<rp>(</rp><rt>たまご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を <ruby>食<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>べます</span>。<span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&hellip;Tôi ăn bánh m&igrave; và trứng.<span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"></div></div></div></span></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">3．</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai6_rb_3.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"></span><span>けさ <ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なに</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を <ruby>食<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>べましたか。</span><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Sáng nay anh/chị đã ăn g&igrave;?<span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"></div></div></div></span></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"></span><span>&hellip;<ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なに</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>も <ruby>食<rp>(</rp><rt>た</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>べませんでした。</span><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&hellip;Tôi không ăn g&igrave; cả.<span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"></div></div></div></span></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">4．</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai6_rb_4.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"></span><span><ruby>土曜日<rp>(</rp><rt>どようび</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby> <ruby>何<rp>(</rp><rt>なに</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を しましたか</span>。<span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Thứ bảy anh/chị đã làm g&igrave;?<span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"></div></div></div></span></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"></span><span>&hellip;<ruby>日本語<rp>(</rp><rt>にほんご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を <ruby>勉強<rp>(</rp><rt>べんきょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しました。それから <ruby>友達<rp>(</rp><rt>ともだち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と <ruby>映画<rp>(</rp><rt>えいが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を <ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ました。</span><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&hellip;Tôi (đã) học tiếng Nhật. Sau đó đi xem phim cùng bạn.<span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"></div></div></div></span></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">5．</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai6_rb_5.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"></span><span>どこで その かばんを <ruby>買<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いましたか。</span><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"></span> </span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Anh/chị (đã) mua cái cặp đó ở đâu?<span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"></div></div></div></span></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"></span><span>&hellip; メキシコで <ruby>買<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いました。</span><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&hellip;Tôi (đã) mua ở Mexico.<span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"></div></div></div></span></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">6．</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai6_rb_6.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"></span><span>あした テニスを しませんか。</span><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"></span> </span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Ngày mai chơi Tenis với tôi không?<span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"></div></div></div></span></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"></span><span>&hellip; ええ、いいですね。</span><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&hellip;Được, tốt quá!<span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"></div></div></div></span></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">7．</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/Minna_Bai6_rb_6.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"></span><span>あした 10<ruby>時<rp>(</rp><rt>じ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に <ruby>駅<rp>(</rp><rt>えき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で あいましょう。</span><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"></span> </span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Ngày mai gặp nhau tại nhà ga vào lúc 10 giờ nhé.<span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"></div></div></div></span></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"></span><span>&hellip; わかりました。</span><span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&hellip;Tôi hiểu rồi.<span style=\"font-family: arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"></div></div></div></span></span></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:14px;\"></div>",
